#Linux
Soo-saar qor: (Amar ls -la), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (Waddo /home gabor Desktop), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: (Waddo /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ((Amar ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ((Amar do: ['this'], iyo: ['that'])), sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: ((Waddo go: ['here'], iyo: ['there'])), sadar-cusub.